From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 15:27:41 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8140: enable the JPEG encoder on the J700

Drop the 4 GiB client DMA window from the JPEG engines, which take 64-bit
addresses, and enable jpeg0 on the J700. Build the driver as a module.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
(backported from commit f74d69e18178650ea64590bbf6eab8fa2c890892)
[j604: asahi.config hunk only (CONFIG_VIDEO_APPLE_JPEG=m, placed after CONFIG_VIDEO_APPLE_ISP=m because 1.607 has no AVE/ProRes lines); the T8140/J700 DT hunks are dropped]
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/asahi.config | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/asahi.config b/arch/arm64/configs/asahi.config
index d8d8eb31f6..b8487dd376 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/asahi.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/asahi.config
@@ -46,6 +46,7 @@ CONFIG_MTD=y
 CONFIG_MTD_PHRAM=m
 CONFIG_VIDEO_APPLE_AVD=m
 CONFIG_VIDEO_APPLE_ISP=m
+CONFIG_VIDEO_APPLE_JPEG=m
 CONFIG_DRM=y
 CONFIG_DRM_ASAHI=m
 CONFIG_DRM_ASAHI_G16=y
